      "id": "docs_platforms_adapters_response_policies",
      "label": "Boundary Response Policies (cors, securityHeaders, etag, compression)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Run at the request/response boundary on every platform without reading the container; compression is gzip-only and ETag is SHA-1 by deliberate design.",
